From 0aeb5be3a3e642b6a7ae6029a82d7d706dca9156 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivory <contact@ivory.cafe>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 22:41:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 32/32] manager: expose the full config surface + app actions
 over MCP

set_config now overlays any of the 35 schema fields by name (force_class,
walk_delay_ms, manifest_max_components, ...) onto the profile-seeded draft via
toJson->merge->fromJson, with friendly aliases (process main/all, walk_mode,
walk_start, force_invoke, anr_protection, capture_mask). Add launch_app,
stop_app and recover tools so an MCP client can drive the whole pipeline --
configure (any field), enable/disable, cold-start/stop the target, recover, and
repair_export -- matching every capability the UI has. Enables iterating the
FART-style delay + active-invocation strategy (walk_delay_ms + force_invoke)
entirely over MCP.
---
 .../android/r0dumpmanager/mcp/McpServer.kt    | 116 ++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 103 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/com/android/r0dumpmanager/mcp/McpServer.kt b/src/com/android/r0dumpmanager/mcp/McpServer.kt
index 0b4cc8b..5e8ea89 100644
